WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.667
In this video, you'll learn how to bring shoppers to your Brand Store homepage using Sponsored Brands

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:06.000
campaigns.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.781
While you can choose different landing page options for your ads, linking to your Brand Store allows

00:00:10.781 --> 00:00:15.000
shoppers to discover everything you offer while seeing the elements that make your brand unique.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.172
In your Brand Store Insights, you can measure shopper engagement from your Sponsored Brands ads

00:00:20.172 --> 00:00:25.000
by tracking metrics like page views, visits, and sales per page by traffic source.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.889
Step 1.

00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:28.111
Create a sponsored Brands Campaign.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:33.000
Create a sponsored Brands Campaign in product collection or video format.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Then set your Brand Store homepage as your ad landing page.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:38.737
Step 2.

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:39.842
Select Engaging Creative.

00:00:39.842 --> 00:00:45.000
Create a good first impression with engaging creative that draws shoppers to your store.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.706
Choose between video ads that bring your products to life or product collection ads with lifestyle

00:00:49.706 --> 00:00:50.000
imagery.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.727
Video ads should be brief, around 20 seconds, and grab attention in the first few moments as they

00:00:55.727 --> 00:00:57.000
autoplay in search results.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
For product collections, use high-quality lifestyle images that show your products in real settings.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Our AI image generator can help create these visuals while maintaining your brand standards.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.200
Step 3.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.000
Write a Headline.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Add a headline that communicates your product's unique value and inspires trust.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:16.667
Step 4.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:17.667
Select your products.

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:22.000
Think of your ad creative as telling your product's story at a glance.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Feature bestsellers, highly rated products with three or more stars, or new launches in your creative.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.842
Step 5.

00:01:28.842 --> 00:01:29.263
Targeting.

00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:35.579
Create separate ad groups or campaigns for targeting strategy to tailor your message for better

00:01:35.579 --> 00:01:36.000
control.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.000
If using keyword targeting, select your branded terms to help capture brand-aware shoppers.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.000
When trying to reach new to brand shoppers, use category-specific and broader keywords.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.647
Learn from shopper interests by using keyword themes and your search terms report to spot relevant

00:01:52.647 --> 00:01:53.000
terms.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:00.000
For product targeting, begin with relevant category groups refining those to match your offerings.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:00.857
Step 6.

00:02:00.857 --> 00:02:03.000
Craft a Compelling Brand Store.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Craft a compelling brand store that guides shoppers from your ads to purchase,

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:12.000
featuring clear navigation, authentic lifestyle imagery and your unique brand story.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.000
By aligning your Sponsored Brands ads with your brand store homepage,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:21.000
you create a cohesive shopping experience that introduces your brand and encourages return visits.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.538
Put learning into practice.

00:02:22.538 --> 00:02:26.000
Create a Sponsored Brands campaign driving to your homepage.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.400
Watch our other two videos in this series to learn more ways to connect sponsored brands to your

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.000
brand store.
